    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Duck Hunt 3D is not affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by, endorsed by, or in any way connected to Nintendo video game company or Duck Hunt (TM).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic hand eye coordination activity that's not as messy or too much when you want to relax and enjoy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced mixture of 2D and 3D graphic assets with a slight paralax effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting scoring system adds to the fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique control system focused on handheld and joypad gaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for left-handed people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAPHICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next generation  arcade game in a cute cartoon 3D world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay includes simple retro-arcade mechanics and modern competitive process. Interesting rounds, reworked levels, bonuses, enemies, bosses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique control system &quot;Smart and Convenient&quot; focused on handheld and joypad gaming. You can enjoy the game without a lightgun or mouse.\u00a0Suitable for left-handed people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREDITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Igor Bronnikov | programming, modeling, animation, level design, management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa Bronnikova | voice acting, gameplay advising, art design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleksandr Bronnikov | gameplay advising, product testing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danyl Vindiuk (danyvin) | music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eskoma, AlexM76, CuttlefishM, FxProSound, Sound-Ideas, sounddogs | SFX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Duck Hunt 3D is not affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by, endorsed by, or in any way connected to Nintendo video game company or Duck Hunt (TM).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic hand eye coordination activity that's not as messy or too much when you want to relax and enjoy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced mixture of 2D and 3D graphic assets with a slight paralax effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting scoring system adds to the fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique control system focused on handheld and joypad gaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for left-handed people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAPHICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next generation  arcade game in a cute cartoon 3D world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay includes simple retro-arcade mechanics and modern competitive process. Interesting rounds, reworked levels, bonuses, enemies, bosses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique control system &quot;Smart and Convenient&quot; focused on handheld and joypad gaming. You can enjoy the game without a lightgun or mouse.\u00a0Suitable for left-handed people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREDITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Igor Bronnikov | programming, modeling, animation, level design, management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa Bronnikova | voice acting, gameplay advising, art design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ale